  "label": "User projected onto the younger woman as the agent of the gender swap joke",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the younger woman (woman_on_left) because the text 'it started when i ls swapped my mustang' uses 'i' to refer to the subject of the joke, which is visually represented by the younger woman. The meme implies the user (or the viewer identifying with the younger woman) is the one who 'swapped' their gender, creating a direct projection of the user onto this visual entity.",
